  "transformations": [
    "Exclude legacy CI, Node release tooling and shared maintainer tests from consumer packages; retain probes in tests/recipes.",
    "Retain seven Composer names and directory basenames; add separate sous-core-layout-builder and sous-config-split names.",
    "Bound inter-package requirements to ^2.0, use stable dependency resolution and Drupal core ^11.4.11 baseline.",
    "Fold starter Frontpage fields/displays, Page/Frontpage Pathauto and Page path widget into Content Types; do not depend on Admin.",
    "Fold native management Views/provider modules into Admin while retaining its Gin/login strict configuration whitelist.",
    "Fold Frontpage Paragraphs host/display and both Body/Content tab repairs into Paragraphs without replacing other Field Group tabs.",
    "Change the native core-layout recipe prerequisite to sous-content-types and preserve independent optional composition closure.",
    "Preserve installed nested Formats Linkit and Admin missing-role migration paths.",
    "Distribute Paragraphs under confirmed Sous GPL-2.0-or-later intent and preserve its full original MIT license notice in NOTICE.",
    "Remove dependency-local Dropzone repository metadata; consuming roots must retain the documented library repository definition.",
    "Replace package documentation with monorepo contributor references and source-only test paths.",
    "Keep Media owned and non-View imported configuration strict; exclude only native media/media_library Views from the strict list so Admin-first compositions and project-owned Views are preserved while standalone installs still import missing Views."
